Subramanian et al. developed a so-called enrichment score (ES) that is defined as the maximum deviation of Phit − Pmiss from zero. We proposed a slightly different approach, which we referred to as the AUC. Compared to the ES, the AUC describes the complete dynamic of enrichment curves. We computed the AUCs as follows:3\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
